s, and its lush, hand-drawn natural environments, are direct thematic and aesthetic heirs to Totoro.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw116","target":"aw145","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The film's focus on a family unit coping with parental absence and the introduction of a non-human, powerful yet gentle creature (Stitch) who becomes a family member echoes the dynamic between the sisters and Totoro.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw116","target":"aw153","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"Miyazaki revisited the themes of innocent childhood wonder and powerful, non-threatening magic for a younger audience, using a similarly gentle narrative structure and eschewing a traditional villain, much like in Totoro.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw116","target":"aw132","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Critics frequently compare Mei's discovery of Totoro by following smaller spirits down a tunnel of roots to Alice following the White Rabbit down the rabbit hole, both initiating a journey into a hidden, magical world.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw116","target":"aw141","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Miyazaki worked on the concept and layout for this short film, which features a young girl befriending a large, gentle panda bear. The character dynamics and creature design are a clear thematic and visual precursor to Totoro.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw153","target":"aw116","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Thematically, Ponyo is a spiritual successor to Totoro, marking Miyazaki's return to a story told from the pure, non-judgmental perspective of very young children, where the magical and natural worlds seamlessly intertwine.","direction":"incoming"},{"source":"aw11","target":"aw116","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Miyazaki's own prior work explores the interaction between children and the spirit world, establishing themes of nature spirits, childhood resilience, and maternal separation that are central to Spirited Away.","direction":"incoming"},{"source":"aw169","target":"aw116","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"As Miyazaki's immediately preceding feature film, its gentle pacing, focus on the inner world of its young female protagonists, and low-stakes narrative directly informed the tone and character-driven approach of Kiki's Delivery Service.","direction":"incoming"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw116","aw116","aw116","aw116","aw116"],"influences":["aw116","aw116","aw116"]},"stats":{"total_connected":7,"influences_count":2,"influenced_count":6,"filter":"all","vault_count":0,"beyond_count":7}}